    "detailed_description": "<strong>Bunny Hop : Eggstreme</strong> is a 3D platformer based on strafing, surfing, and many more unique movement mechanics. Beat your own records or your friends on the leaderboard, collect hidden easter eggs, run through biome-themed levels. Play online with your friends or alone, find new routes or just enjoy the view.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Bunny Hop<br></li><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li>Replays<br></li><li>Global leaderboards<br></li><li>Customization<br></li><li>Easter eggs<br></li><li>More than 20 different levels<br></li><li>A lot of fun</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join us on Discord !</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Bunny Hop : Eggstreme</strong> is a 3D platformer based on strafing, surfing, and many more unique movement mechanics. Beat your own records or your friends on the leaderboard, collect hidden easter eggs, run through biome-themed levels. Play online with your friends or alone, find new routes or just enjoy the view.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Bunny Hop<br></li><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li>Replays<br></li><li>Global leaderboards<br></li><li>Customization<br></li><li>Easter eggs<br></li><li>More than 20 different levels<br></li><li>A lot of fun</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join us on Discord !</h2>",
    "short_description": "Bunny Hop : Eggstreme is a challenging 3D first-person platformer based on the famous movement feature called &quot;bunny hop&quot;. Beat your friends, explore the world, find all the secrets this universe offers you and become the very bester bhopper the world has ever known.",
